<title>UK: LME details Easter stock release dates.</title>
<headline>LME details Easter stock release dates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Metal Exchange (LME) has detailed the release dates of its warehouse stock figures over the Easter period.</p>
<p>In a notice to members the LME said that owing to UK public holidays on Friday 28 March and Monday 31 March the report up to and including 27 March will be released on Tuesday 1 April.</p>
<p>The next stock report will be published Friday 4 April for inventories up to and including 3 April.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542-8075</p>
